its place and jumps to the top.</p>\n<p>The fix keeps the rows and changes only what's different:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-rust\">let fresh = project_rows(project, input);\nmerge_by_key(&amp;mut rows, fresh);\n</code></pre>\n<p>All 112 tests pass.</p>\n","key":"msg_20f7c71a9003Q3LgLsUtmNcL17/text/0","kind":"markdown","state":"done","text":"Found it. `rebuild()` in `src/sidebar.rs` clears **every row** whenever one session's status changes, so the list view loses its place and jumps to the top.\n\nThe fix keeps the rows and changes only what's different:\n\n```rust\nlet fresh = project_rows(project, input);\nmerge_by_key(&mut rows, fresh);\n```\n\nAll 112 tests pass."}]}],"ev":"rows","key":"ses_df0838e72ffeMD2Sd4Yn817mX8"}}
